# Recordings, results and the generated request never enter git: recordings are people, results quote them,
# and the request template is regenerated from your server's code rather than committed, so it cannot drift.
# Keys are never in a file at all; they live in the shell's environment.
clips/
results/
.venv/
.env*
!.env.example
request-template.json
*.wav
__pycache__/
